Martin Heyden: SVE-2025-2255<font></font>
Brendon Tiszka and Mateusz Jurczyk of Google Project Zero: SVE-2025-2316</font></pre>
		                	
		                	<br>
		                	<strong><font size="4">Version</font></strong><br>
		                	<pre style="font-family: &quot;SamsungOne&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin-left:-10px"><font size="3"><div><table cellpadding="0" style="width:100%"><colgroup><col width="25%"><col width="25%"><col></colgroup><thead><tr><th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;line-height:20px;font-size:4;border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd;background:#eee">Version</th><th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;line-height:20px;font-size:4;border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd;background:#eee">Date</th><th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;line-height:20px;font-size:4;border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd;background:#eee">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">1.0</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">January 6, 2026</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">Bulletin published</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">1.1</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">January 8, 2026</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">CVE List updated</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">1.2</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">January 9, 2026</td><td style="padding:10px;line-height:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;font-size:3">SVE List updated</td></tr></tbody></table></div><br></font></pre>
		                	
